I get down from the bus in South Mumbai.
This area is very busy.
There is a lot of crowd on the streets here.
The bus conductor says, "Go straight towards the sea."
I look around.
I walk straight.
Then I see a large street.
I mistakenly turn left.
This is a commercial street.
There are many shops here.
People are walking very fast.
I walk for ten minutes.
But where is the sea?
I do not see the water.
I only hear the noise of vehicles.
I am walking away from the sea.
I am on the wrong street.
I am lost.
